# Spec 026 T7.6, the console smoke test of the 3D backend (spec 013 script). The backend's own check of its fixed
# projection fix-up is logged at init ("3d tilt: PASS"); DOWN opens the smoke scene: a flat (unlit) cube, then (A) a
# lit, textured one. Read both screenshots beside the PC's (same geometry; colours close).
# PC:      nnh run models --pc --script examples/models/tests/smoke.nnhs
# Console: nnh run models --script examples/models/tests/smoke.nnhs   (Homebrew Launcher open, press Y)
fail-on "] E "
fail-on "3d tilt: FAIL"
expect "3d tilt: PASS" 120
# (the showcase starts at frame 0, before the script can see its lines)
wait 30
tap DOWN
expect "smoke: flat" 20
wait 10
screenshot flat
tap A
expect "smoke: lit" 30
wait 10
screenshot lit
end
